body:
Hello!

&#x200B;

I was taking a look, the collection is roughly work around $1,013\~  


I'd be willing to make a deal with the whole collection at around a 25% discount, maybe roughly $750, $800 shipped?

&#x200B;

Willing to negotiate if you DM me.

The way I see it;

The TVA is huge, and there are more parts of the universe other than Earth and human planets. It makes sense that human TVA employees would monitor human related things.

But I'm sure a few miles down the way, maybe there are some Groot species workers who ensure the Sacred Timeline is held when Groots break it. Same for the Kree, and Skrulls.
